"name":"西向公園","category":"nature","address":"尾張旭市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23226","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"尾張旭市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.02913299,35.21493793]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"東山公園","category":"nature","address":"尾張旭市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23226","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"尾張旭市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.01653473,35.1995336]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"越水公園","category":"nature","address":"尾張旭市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"23226","municipality_pref":"愛知県","municipality_name":"尾張旭市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.02165728,35.21024449]}}],"display_comment_original":"尾張旭市周辺には、近世村の記憶として印場村、新居村、稲葉村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、新居城跡、長坂遺跡、越田和遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、印場村、新居村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["新居城（旭城）","退養寺","洞光院","三郷庵","少林寺","庄中観音堂","福田寺","法遍寺"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%BE%E5%BC%B5%E6%97%AD%E5%B8%82"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"尾張旭市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110802076","wikidata_qid":"Q694893","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%BE%E5%BC%B5%E6%97%AD%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}